h3 MCP
p.text-muted.mb-4(translate) Allow agents to discover Tabby connections through Model Context Protocol.

section.mcp-section
    .section-heading
        h4.mb-0(translate) Server configuration
        span.text-success(*ngIf='mcp.address', translate) Running
        span.text-muted(*ngIf='!mcp.address', translate) Stopped
    .form-line
        .header
            .title(translate) Enable MCP server
            .description(translate) Listen on this computer only. Requests require a bearer token and an unlocked vault.
        toggle([ngModel]='mcp.settings.enabled', (ngModelChange)='saveSettings($event)', [disabled]='busy')
    .form-line.port-line
        .header
            label.title(for='mcp-port', translate) Port
            .description(translate) Leave empty to reuse the previous automatic port, or choose a free port automatically.
        .port-input
            input#mcp-port.form-control(type='number', min='1', max='65535', [(ngModel)]='port', [disabled]='busy')
            button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='saveSettings()', [disabled]='busy', translate) Apply
    .server-address
        .address-copy
            span(translate) Server address
            code {{mcp.address || previewAddress}}
        button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='copy(mcp.address!)', *ngIf='mcp.address', translate) Copy
    p.text-muted.mb-0.mt-2(*ngIf='!mcp.address && !mcp.error', translate) Server is stopped or managed by the main window.

.alert.alert-danger(*ngIf='mcp.error', role='alert') {{mcp.error | translate}}
.alert.alert-danger(*ngIf='error', role='alert') {{error | translate}}
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='!mcp.isMainWindow', translate) MCP runs in the main window. Unlock the vault in that window before connecting an agent.
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='!vault.isEnabled()', translate) Configure the vault in Vault settings before creating tokens.
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='vault.isEnabled() && !vault.isOpen()')
    p(translate) Unlock the vault to allow MCP requests. Requests are rejected while it is locked.
    button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='unlockVault()', [disabled]='busy || !mcp.isMainWindow', translate) Unlock vault

section
    .section-heading
        .header
            h4(translate) Tokens
            p.text-muted.mb-0(translate) Each token has its own tool capabilities and access permissions.
        button.btn.btn-primary(type='button', (click)='openEditor()', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen || !vault.isEnabled() || !!createdToken', translate) Create token
    p.text-muted(translate) Use Authorization: Bearer TOKEN when connecting an agent. Each token has its own tools and connection access.
    .alert.alert-warning(*ngIf='createdToken', role='status')
        p(translate) Copy this token now. It will only be shown once.
        code.d-block.text-break.selectable {{createdToken}}
        button.btn.btn-secondary.mt-2(type='button', (click)='copy(createdToken!)', translate) Copy token
        button.btn.btn-primary.mt-2.ms-2(type='button', (click)='createdToken = null', translate) Done
    .mcp-section.token-list
        p.text-muted.p-3.mb-0(*ngIf='!mcp.settings.tokens.length', translate) No tokens yet.
        .token-row(*ngFor='let token of mcp.settings.tokens')
            .token-details
                .token-name {{tokenLabel(token)}}
                code.text-muted(*ngIf='token.name && token.preview') {{token.preview}}
                .token-summary.text-muted
                    span(translate='Capabilities: {count} / {total}', [translateParams]='{count: token.capabilities.length, total: toolCount}')
                    span(translate='Included connections: {count}', [translateParams]='{count: includedConnectionCount(token)}')
            .token-actions
                button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='openEditor(token)', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen || !!createdToken', translate) View details
                button.btn.btn-danger(type='button', (click)='removeToken(token)', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen', translate) Revoke
